Third-party data and models referenced by this repository:

- HotpotQA (distractor setting) - https://hotpotqa.github.io/ - CC BY-SA 4.0.
  Only sampling and shuffling are applied; questions and supporting facts are
  unmodified.
- BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 and Xenova/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2 (via fastembed) -
  see their model cards on Hugging Face for the applicable licenses. Models are
  downloaded at runtime and are not redistributed here.
